### Accueil
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Page d'accueil secondaire
GET http://localhost:3000/home

### Page utilisateur
GET http://localhost:3000/user/123

### Récupérer tous les contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### Récupérer un contact par son ID
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/6ad363b92c5caf8f1aedef7a

### Ajouter un contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "tl100to",
  "age": 34
}

### Modifier un contact
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/6ad363b92c5caf8f1aedef7a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "toto modifié",
  "age": 26
}

### Supprimer un contact
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/6ad363b92c5caf8f1aedef7a
